47229301 (2193 1792702655725 "guenchi" (("w5vbequy" . 14982)) (put ((kind . section) (title . "landing f319") (src . "rules: a write's + facts are read by their bound arguments and charged by the rows matched\n\nA WRITE rule's facts (kind+, field+, edge+, edge-kind+) were read by scanning\nthe whole relation on every dispatch and charging its full size against the\nwrite's one budget, so a batch of a few hundred inserts under any rule\nnaming field+ was refused rule-unevaluable (query-budget, field+) before a\nselector was asked: about 47 N^2 tuples for N inserts, exhausted near 70.\nThe handler now filters the relation by the goal's bound arguments, keeps\nthe filtered tuples per call in the session memo, and charges the matched\ncount each time the goal is dispatched: the charge equals the unification\nwork done, a join whose final test rejects every pair is bounded as before,\nand a batch of 307 ledger inserts under the ledger's nine rules passes\n(the same batch is refused on the base). test/rule-check.sc grows a W\nsection (the 300-insert batch, the charge per dispatch, an over-budget join\nstill refused naming field+, a rejected product); the README's budget\nparagraph says a + fact is charged by its matched rows each time it is made.\n") (parent . root) (ord . 454))))
